t`: Formatted professionally without emojis.\n- **In Progress / Target for Next Turn:**\n  - Applying the **UX & Format restructuring** to `app.py` lines 640–1490 (a large single-block edit failed due to model token capacity/mismatch on target chunk; must be applied in smaller, targeted chunks).\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings & Technical Decisions\n- **UX Restructuring Plan:**\n  - **Header (lines ~640–720):** Streamline into an integrated Executive Command Bar (Title + Live Status + Latency) and 5 high-impact KPI tiles (`Units Inspected`, `Defect Rate %`, `Primary Constraint`, `Operating Margin $`, `AI Core Status`).\n  - **Tab 1 (lines ~730–880):** Convert from a flat gallery into a **Split-Screen Interactive Diagnostic Studio**:\n    - Left Column (1/3): Searchable/filterable unit queue list with status pills and quick unit selector.\n    - Right Column (2/3): High-res visual inspector (mode switcher tabs: Grad-CAM, Bounding Box, Clean View, Raw Image) + Automated Industrial Prescription card (Accept/Reject/Rework/Review) + class probabilities breakdown.\n    - Bottom: Defect Breakdown Donut + Frequency Bar + Batch Drift Log.\n  - **Tab 2 (lines ~880–960):** Clean SCADA conveyor simulation with 4 metric chips + 2-column constraint deep dive vs station utilization bars.\n  - **Tab 3 (lines ~965–1040):** Priority filter buttons (`[All Priority]`, `[High Priority Only]`, `[Medium]`, `[Low]`) + 2-column evidence cards vs drift/OOD reviews.\n  - **Tab 4 (lines ~1040–1225):** 2-column economic waterfall vs What-If sliders with margin lift tiles + full-width 3D optimization surface landscape below.\n  - **Tab 5 (lines ~1230–1490):** Retain and polish the neural surrogate digital twin cockpit.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Active Context & State\n- **Project Directory:** `C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\\`\n- **Key Files:**\n  - `app.py` (~1,491 lines currently)\n  - `utils/chart_helpers.py` (verified clean, all 14 functions exported)\n  - `modules/production_analyzer.py`, `modules/profitability.py`, `modules/root_cause.py`, `modules/ann_surrogate.py` (all compiling clean)\n- **PowerShell Syntax Rule:** Use `;` instead of `&&` when chaining commands.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. **Apply UX & Format edits in `app.py` in targeted chunks:**\n   - Chunk 1: Update Top Command Header & KPI strip (lines ~640–720).\n   - Chunk 2: Update Tab 1 to the Split-Screen Interactive Diagnostic Studio (lines ~730–880).\n   - Chunk 3: Update Tab 2, Tab 3, and Tab 4 formatting for improved layout structure.\n2. **Compile Check:**\n   - Run `python -m py_compile app.py utils/chart_helpers.py` via `run_command` to verify zero syntax errors.\n3. **Smoke Test:**\n   - Verify that Streamlit runs cleanly without import errors or UI crashes.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Keep the quiet-luxury, classy styling (no neons/emojis).\n- Ensure all interactive controls (unit selector, mode tabs, What-If sliders, 3D surface plot) work smoothly without breaking backend hooks.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 5 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789840749044]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2/.user_uploaded/media_1789840749044.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-19T17:59:23Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: architecture]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2/architecture.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-19T19:42:35Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: implementation_plan]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2/implementation_plan.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-19T21:11:52Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: task]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2/task.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-19T21:13:25Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: walkthrough]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2/walkthrough.md\nLast Edited: 2026-